WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Open Zenodo Account Retrieval with a safe sandbox fixture.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Select the sandbox recording credential and run a local-worker preflight.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Review the completed retrieval collection, progress, diagnostics, and generated shard.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Search the persisted shard collection for the synthetic amphora record.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Run the community-migration detector and inspect the local candidate result.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:52.000
The workflow uses synthetic records and never exposes a token or private account data.
